<p>Enroll your development device into the <a href=3D"https://developers.go=
ogle.com/android/guides/beta-program" target=3D"_blank">Google system servi=
ces beta channel</a> to use test mode:</p>
<ol type=3D"1">
<li>Browse to the <a href=3D"https://play.google.com/apps/testing/com.googl=
e.android.gms" target=3D"_blank">Android App Testing - Google system servic=
es</a> page.</li>
<li>Click <strong>Become a tester</strong>.</li>
</ol>
<p>You're now a beta tester for Google system services.</p>
