<h2 is-upgraded=3D"" id=3D"generate-a-test-token" data-text=3D"Generate a t=
est token" tabindex=3D"-1">Generate a test token</h2>
<ol type=3D"1">
<li>In the Firebase console, go to <strong>Security</strong> &gt; <a href=
=3D"https://console.firebase.google.com/project/_/phoneverification" target=
=3D"_blank"><strong>Phone Verification</strong></a>.</li>
<li>Select the <strong>Testing</strong> tab.</li>
<li>Select the country code for your testing phone number and click <strong=
>Generate token</strong>.</li>
<li>Copy the generated token string.</li>
</ol>
<aside class=3D"warning"><p> Note: Test tokens expire after 7 days. You'll =
need to generate a new one if it expires during development.</p>
</aside>
